      "statement": "myfeeder is a self-hosted, single-user feed reader (RSS/Atom/JSON Feed) built on Spring Boot 4.0.8 with Java 25, using Spring Data JDBC (not JPA) and Flyway for PostgreSQL schema migration, with a React 19 + TypeScript SPA frontend embedded into the Spring Boot jar's static resources.",
